Subject: [PATCH 5/9] CH02 refactoring: Replace Conditional with Polymorphism

Smell: Switch Statements - loop() branched on the type code
self.direction with mirrored 'raise'/'lower' branches
(bang_bang.py:220-243 after CH01). Each direction is now an
IrrigationStrategy (RaiseHysteresisStrategy, LowerHysteresisStrategy in
mycodo/utils/irrigation_strategies.py); loop() asks the strategy for a
decision and _apply_decision() sends it. Behaviour unchanged.

